  "_comment_ceiling": "design 3.0 (pilot 0, before the freeze): SEED + seed_offset, P sessions of each world (the other sets at the smoke size, unused), AUC(A) and AUC(A_speed) per label and classifier, out of fold. A world is usable when the smaller of the two classifiers' L300 AUC(A_speed) is <= usable_max (equality is usable); the first usable world in prefer is chosen; none usable -> back to the researcher.",
